e date \"20TH SEPTEMBER 2025 1PM-10PM\", the lineup (Archie Briant), and the venue \"93 FEET EAST 150 BRICK LANE, LONDON, E1 6QL\". 3. Color & Texture Dominated by a green base, pink graffiti outlines, and white typography, the design overlays cartoon figures and DJ elements to recreate the retro, playful texture of 90s underground EDM party posters. It perfectly blends the humor of the cartoon crocodiles, the dynamic energy of electronic music elements, and the visual tension of the contrasting colors—capturing both the carnival spirit of the party and the laid-back vibe of retro graffiti."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [718.394775390625, 289.5167236328125], "pos": [101.75931549072266, -2310.928466796875], "id": 456, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "unknown", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [44089], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [44090], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["2:3 (Portrait Photo)", 2.2, 8], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "